                <div class="container">
                    <header class="section-header">
                        <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
                        <h2 class="section-title">
                            Why Book With Us?</h2>
                        <div class="section-content">
                            <p>We are an experienced agency with a proven track record for
                                Travel and Tours in Nepal</p>
                        </div>
                    </header>
                    <div class="features-holder">
                        <div class="grid">
                            <div class="col">
  <div class="icon-holder">
    <svg width="60" height="60">
        <circle cx="14" cy="29" r="29" transform="rotate(-90, 22, 22)"></circle>
    </svg>
    <i class="fa fa-check "></i>
  </div>
  <div class="text-holder">
    <h3 class="title">Direct Operator -  Local Owner</h3>                          
    <p>We are direct operators. You book with us, you trek with us. We are a renowned local trekking agency in Nepal that has been organizing treks and tours for many years.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="col">
  <div class="icon-holder">
    <svg width="60" height="60">
        <circle cx="14" cy="29" r="29" transform="rotate(-90, 22, 22)"></circle>
    </svg>
    <i class="fa fa-check "></i>
  </div>
  <div class="text-holder">
    <h3 class="title">Value of Money - No Middle man</h3>                          
    <p>Your trip   book  directly with us. This will save your money since there won’t be the engagement of any third party. </p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="col">
  <div class="icon-holder">
    <svg width="60" height="60">
        <circle cx="14" cy="29" r="29" transform="rotate(-90, 22, 22)"></circle>
    </svg>
    <i class="fa fa-check "></i>
  </div>
  <div class="text-holder">
    <h3 class="title">Quality  Of Service and Competitive price</h3>                          
    <p>We have a suitable cost for all our trek and tour packages. In the competitive market price, we provide excellent services. Also, we are transparent, what you see on our site is the amount that you pay. Be assured, there are no hidden costs.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="col">
  <div class="icon-holder">
    <svg width="60" height="60">
        <circle cx="14" cy="29" r="29" transform="rotate(-90, 22, 22)"></circle>
    </svg>
    <i class="fa fa-check "></i>
  </div>
  <div class="text-holder">
    <h3 class="title">Highly trained & experienced tour leaders</h3>                          
    <p>We organize safe treks and travels with our highly trained guides who have years of trekking and mountaineering experiences in the Himalayas of Nepal.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="col">
  <div class="icon-holder">
    <svg width="60" height="60">
        <circle cx="14" cy="29" r="29" transform="rotate(-90, 22, 22)"></circle>
    </svg>
    <i class="fa fa-check "></i>
  </div>
  <div class="text-holder">
    <h3 class="title">Flexible and customization trip itinerary</h3>                          
